Wait, why does it say cell phone right there?

2501
02:52:33,770 --> 02:52:35,270
Oh, it's because there's only one thing.

2502
02:52:35,270 --> 02:52:35,970
I understand.

2503
02:52:36,630 --> 02:52:37,030
Ruby.

2504
02:52:40,700 --> 02:52:41,300
There.

2505
02:52:42,200 --> 02:52:42,460
In.

2506
02:52:43,600 --> 02:52:44,720
Cobwebs can go back.

2507
02:52:46,700 --> 02:52:48,160
Still can also go in here.

2508
02:52:48,480 --> 02:52:49,200
This one is up here.

2509
02:52:50,980 --> 02:52:51,620
Fire Blossom.

2510
02:52:53,120 --> 02:52:53,720
Obsidian.

2511
02:52:55,480 --> 02:52:55,740
Okay.

2512
02:52:56,360 --> 02:52:59,860
Which one allowed me to make the one summon extra?

2513
02:53:02,320 --> 02:53:03,940
It was not this, was it?

2514
02:53:05,860 --> 02:53:06,480
It was.

2515
02:53:10,160 --> 02:53:11,840
Oh, but I can't make it because of shadow skill, right?

2516
02:53:12,560 --> 02:53:14,720
But there was another one with a gem, I believe.

2517
02:53:16,260 --> 02:53:17,960
So now, of course, I put all my gems away.

2518
02:53:18,180 --> 02:53:18,480
Great.

2519
02:53:19,500 --> 02:53:20,720
Let me just try these real quick.

2520
02:53:21,800 --> 02:53:22,660
Which one was it?

2521
02:53:28,200 --> 02:53:31,040
No, this is just reduced mana cost and stuff like that.

2522
02:53:33,520 --> 02:53:34,240
Ah, crap.

2523
02:53:34,540 --> 02:53:35,880
It was the Flingsphere, I believe.

2524
02:53:38,080 --> 02:53:40,000
But I couldn't make that either, right?

2525
02:53:41,020 --> 02:53:41,540
Reasons?

2526
02:53:45,920 --> 02:53:47,440
I don't even know where I put it.

2527
02:53:47,900 --> 02:53:53,960
No, don't rename sword flings.

2528
02:53:56,440 --> 02:53:58,160
I'm terrible at this, dude.

2529
02:54:00,800 --> 02:54:01,660
Must have been in here.

2530
02:54:08,670 --> 02:54:10,350
Bro, that thing is lost to me now.

2531
02:54:11,070 --> 02:54:13,590
That thing has gone off the face of the earth.

2532
02:54:14,410 --> 02:54:15,850
No idea where I put it.

2533
02:54:17,470 --> 02:54:18,490
God damn it.

2534
02:54:21,400 --> 02:54:22,000
Incredible.

2535
02:54:22,240 --> 02:54:22,840
Oh, up here maybe.

2536
02:54:24,200 --> 02:54:24,800
No.

2537
02:54:31,280 --> 02:54:32,420
Dude, man.

2538
02:54:33,380 --> 02:54:34,380
Where did I put it?

2539
02:54:45,130 --> 02:54:48,130
I can't fucking find my way around this inventory, dude.

2540
02:54:49,310 --> 02:54:51,050
Once you lose something, it's gone.

2541
02:54:52,170 --> 02:54:53,930
It's just so hard to find.

2542
02:54:54,910 --> 02:54:55,650
It's unreal.

2543
02:54:56,150 --> 02:54:57,530
