I have 16 magic power potions there.

2545
02:55:03,290 --> 02:55:04,510
What the heck?

2546
02:55:09,590 --> 02:55:10,110
Yo.

2547
02:55:15,490 --> 02:55:16,630
That thing is gone.

2548
02:55:18,350 --> 02:55:19,330
Alright, whatever.

2549
02:55:20,990 --> 02:55:22,230
Didn't want to make it anyway.

2550
02:55:25,760 --> 02:55:26,800
Put this in here.

2551
02:55:27,480 --> 02:55:27,840
The ore.

2552
02:55:28,380 --> 02:55:28,780
There.

2553
02:55:29,560 --> 02:55:29,940
Gems.

2554
02:55:30,380 --> 02:55:30,660
Here.

2555
02:55:31,320 --> 02:55:32,320
And then I want to go back immediately.

2556
02:55:33,040 --> 02:55:33,360
Let's go.

2557
02:55:34,220 --> 02:55:35,200
No dilly dallying.

2558
02:55:39,310 --> 02:55:42,290
I want to go...

2559
02:55:42,290 --> 02:55:42,730
Man.

2560
02:55:43,210 --> 02:55:43,970
This place.

2561
02:55:44,730 --> 02:55:46,110
Did I miss something here?

2562
02:55:52,960 --> 02:55:53,740
What is this?

2563
02:55:55,320 --> 02:55:56,740
There's something interesting there.

2564
02:55:59,920 --> 02:56:01,300
You know what, let's go back to the jungle.

2565
02:56:02,440 --> 02:56:07,640
Because this right here is a mystery that I would like to get to the bottom of.

2566
02:56:08,180 --> 02:56:10,800
I also want to see what's below the ocean if I dig over here.

2567
02:56:11,580 --> 02:56:12,660
Think about that for a second.

2568
02:56:16,580 --> 02:56:17,060
Yeah.

2569
02:56:20,360 --> 02:56:23,420
I kind of want to build another base somewhere over here.

2570
02:56:24,160 --> 02:56:27,000
I wonder if there's a way to change my respawn location.

2571
02:56:33,610 --> 02:56:34,610
Let's think about this.

2572
02:56:38,080 --> 02:56:39,380
How do I do that?

2573
02:56:39,980 --> 02:56:41,200
There's got to be a way to do that.

2574
02:56:41,320 --> 02:56:42,160
Or maybe not, actually.

2575
02:56:42,480 --> 02:56:43,900
The world is not that big, I guess.

2576
02:56:47,120 --> 02:56:49,260
The underworld is made of a material called hillstone.

2577
02:56:50,160 --> 02:56:50,280
Yeah.

2578
02:56:51,740 --> 02:56:52,580
Keeper of the...

2579
02:56:54,500 --> 02:56:57,060
Oh my god, he actually told me this last time.

2580
02:56:58,580 --> 02:56:58,880
Look!

2581
02:57:00,280 --> 02:57:01,900
Interesting that you would know this, huh?

2582
02:57:04,460 --> 02:57:06,340
The old ones army, yeah, yeah.

2583
02:57:08,100 --> 02:57:11,060
You can remove people from the...

2584
02:57:11,560 --> 02:57:11,780
Obsidian.

2585
02:57:14,180 --> 02:57:17,680
Some say there are giant beehives buried on the ground in the jungle.

2586
02:57:17,820 --> 02:57:19,220
I could do with some honey myself.

2587
02:57:19,600 --> 02:57:20,580
Speaking of that...

2588
02:57:21,840 --> 02:57:22,200
The honey.

2589
02:57:23,220 --> 02:57:24,440
I have no idea how to get that.

2590
02:57:26,320 --> 02:57:27,740
So let's try and find a beehive.

2591
02:57:28,700 --> 02:57:29,760
Put that in there.

2592
02:57:32,610 --> 02:57:34,490
Bottled water can go up here real quick.

2593
02:57:41,030 --> 02:57:42,610
You know what? No.

2594
02:57:43,550 --> 02:57:44,470
We're doing that.

2595
02:57:45,050 --> 02:57:46,030
Oh no!

2596
02:57:48,150 --> 02:57:49,810
What a terrible teleport!

2597
02:57:50,770 --> 02:57:51,090
Again.

2598
02:57:54,800 --> 02:57:55,640
Alright, fine.

2599
02:57:58,480 --> 02:58:00,280
I was hoping we'd get somewhere new.

2600
02:58:01,800 --> 02:58:05,100
In fact, I need to check what it takes to craft one of those teleportation potions.

2601
