And I do mean 2,000.

2603
02:58:10,260 --> 02:58:11,540
Two with three zeros.

2604
02:58:16,640 --> 02:58:17,000
Hello!

2605
02:58:20,260 --> 02:58:20,920
Wait, have I been?

2606
02:58:21,180 --> 02:58:21,860
No, I have not been here.

2607
02:58:22,400 --> 02:58:23,960
Oh my god!

2608
02:58:26,420 --> 02:58:27,240
Ha ha ha!

2609
02:58:36,240 --> 02:58:37,480
I don't know where I'm going right now.

2610
02:58:38,660 --> 02:58:39,620
I'm just going, you know?

2611
02:58:39,740 --> 02:58:41,620
I'm taking... I'm going wherever the wind guides me.

2612
02:58:41,620 --> 02:58:43,160
Even though there's no wind down here.

2613
02:58:44,140 --> 02:58:46,200
Wherever my heart takes me.

2614
02:58:52,360 --> 02:58:54,740
God damn it, I forgot to bring my summons.

2615
02:59:04,430 --> 02:59:05,550
Where am I right now?

2616
02:59:06,330 --> 02:59:08,370
I'm below the, I believe, forest.

2617
02:59:10,470 --> 02:59:11,170
Actually, no.

2618
02:59:11,650 --> 02:59:12,630
Taking back...

2619
02:59:13,150 --> 02:59:13,990
I'm going to go to the jungle.

2620
02:59:15,030 --> 02:59:17,810
I need to get to the bottom of that whole temple there.

2621
02:59:18,490 --> 02:59:20,390
I want to get inside so bad.

2622
02:59:24,540 --> 02:59:25,360
Real bad.

2623
02:59:27,020 --> 02:59:28,780
It's been bugging me for ages.

2624
02:59:41,440 --> 02:59:42,700
Just clear the way ahead.

2625
02:59:43,020 --> 02:59:43,740
Spam the button.

2626
02:59:53,760 --> 02:59:54,640
Eat one of these.

2627
03:00:00,550 --> 03:00:01,030
Accelerate.

2628
03:00:04,180 --> 03:00:05,220
We're not there yet.

2629
03:00:10,700 --> 03:00:12,040
So one thing about this game.

2630
03:00:12,920 --> 03:00:14,320
The bosses are fucking hard.

2631
03:00:16,220 --> 03:00:16,700
Like...

2632
03:00:16,700 --> 03:00:17,800
It's really difficult.

2633
03:00:23,010 --> 03:00:24,470
But I guess the thing I could do.

2634
03:00:26,050 --> 03:00:26,530
So...

2635
03:00:26,530 --> 03:00:27,290
The wall of flesh.

2636
03:00:28,250 --> 03:00:31,750
I guess I could make a platform that is infinitely long.

2637
03:00:32,470 --> 03:00:33,030
You know?

2638
03:00:33,710 --> 03:00:34,370
But I feel like...

2639
03:00:35,610 --> 03:00:37,150
I feel like that's kind of cheap.

2640
03:00:38,490 --> 03:00:39,050
You know?

2641
03:00:39,530 --> 03:00:41,590
Like spending half an hour to build.

2642
03:00:42,330 --> 03:00:42,870
I don't know.

2643
03:00:43,310 --> 03:00:45,730
A million yard-long platform.

2644
03:00:46,270 --> 03:00:47,430
Just to kill the boss.

2645
03:00:47,510 --> 03:00:49,610
I feel like that's not intended, in a way.

2646
03:00:51,790 --> 03:00:52,450
I don't know.

2647
03:00:52,510 --> 03:00:53,130
Maybe I'm just lazy.

2648
03:00:54,890 --> 03:00:55,810
It's also plausible.

2649
03:00:56,150 --> 03:00:57,050
Oh wait, we're in the jungle.

2650
03:00:58,890 --> 03:00:59,210
Okay.

2651
03:01:00,170 --> 03:01:01,170
What was I doing here again?

2652
03:01:03,110 --> 03:01:04,550
How do I gain entrance to that place?

2653
03:01:09,590 --> 03:01:10,270
I don't know.

2654
03:01:12,130 --> 03:01:14,770
I kind of want to just go straight down again, but I've been doing that a lot today.

2655
03:01:17,110 --> 03:01:18,110
Maybe change it up a bit.

2656
03:01:21,070 --> 03:01:23,210
In fact, I'm just going to go down where I already did go down.

2657
03:01:24,830 --> 03:01:26,550
And then just keep going around.

2658
03:01:35,630 --> 03:01:36,070
Yeah.

2659
03:01:36,470 --> 03:01:37,790
Wait a minute, why does this look like that?

2660
03:01:39,350 --> 03:01:41,510
That looks like some kind of messed up version of a jungle.

2661
03:01:43,390 --> 03:01:44,190
I'm going there.

2662
03:01:48,550 --> 03:01:49,430
Totally going there.

2663
03:02:00,050 --> 03:02:00,790
Ultimate speed.

2664
03:02:04,610 --> 03:02:05,490
God, it's dark.

2665
03:02:07,270 --> 03:02:08,590
Just hold the torch, I guess.

2666
03:02:10,770 --> 03:02:11,550
Oh, wait a minute.

2667
03:02:12,350 --> 03:02:14,030
Oh, this is the meteor place.

2668
03:02:19,070 --> 03:02:21,050
I know what fire blocks are.

2669
03:02:21,710 --> 03:02:22,910
It's these.

2670
03:02:25,330 --> 03:02:26,970
Of course, man.

2671
03:02:27,130 --> 03:02:29,270
I completely forgot about them.

2672
03:02:30,670 --> 03:02:31,870
I understand.

2673
03:02:32,990 --> 03:02:33,590
Okay.

2674
03:02:35,810 --> 03:02:37,490
Finally, it's clicking here.

2675
03:02:40,010 --> 03:02:41,610
That makes actually a lot of sense.

2676
03:02:42,010 --> 03:02:45,330
That was really annoying last time having to dig through that.

2677
03:02:47,490 --> 03:02:49,030
It's going to be really easy next time.

2678
03:02:51,050 --> 03:02:51,630
Wait, another one?

2679
03:02:53,270 --> 03:02:53,810
What the heck?

2680
03:03:06,280 --> 03:03:08,000
Oh, wait, this was the messed up jungle.

2681
03:03:12,660 --> 03:03:13,200
Here it is.

2682
03:03:14,040 --> 03:03:15,160
Like, this place is messed up.

2683
03:03:16,340 --> 03:03:17,780
Like, what is going on here, you know?

2684
03:03:18,860 --> 03:03:19,260
Let's dig.

2685
03:03:20,240 --> 03:03:21,200
Man, I have something in my eye.

2686
03:03:30,420 --> 03:03:31,340
Oh, this is going to be annoying.

2687
03:03:35,000 --> 03:03:35,860
200th meteor head.

2688
03:03:38,180 --> 03:03:39,460
I wonder if there's a meteor boss.

2689
03:03:50,880 --> 03:03:51,200
Okay.

2690
03:03:51,200 --> 03:03:52,180
We need light.

2691
03:03:52,300 --> 03:03:53,400
We also need the party.

2692
03:03:55,220 --> 03:03:55,640
Party!

2693
